1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:08,580
Should you fly today? FlightDecide helps general aviation pilots answer the hardest question in flying — before every flight.

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:18,620
Enter your route, aircraft, and loading. FlightDecide gathers the weather, NOTAMs, fuel, and performance data for your departure window.

3
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:26,030
In seconds, you get a clear GO or NO-GO verdict, with the reasoning laid out. Never a black box.

4
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:37,270
Every risk area is checked and scored: route weather, airspace and NOTAMs, performance, weight & balance, and fuel — so nothing slips through a rushed preflight.

5
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:47,420
An AI briefing explains the call in plain language, and the raw data behind it — METARs, TAFs, and NOTAMs — is always one tap away.

6
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:54,700
Weather is decoded for your flight window: VFR, marginal, or IFR at a glance.

7
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:02,650
Your dashboard keeps watch on upcoming flights and flags when conditions change — before you drive to the airport.

8
00:01:03,350 --> 00:01:13,800
FlightDecide is decision support — a second opinion, not a substitute for your briefing. The final call is always yours. Learn more at flightdecide.com.
